#: src/index.js:113
msgid "Used by Native Share, WhatsApp, email, Telegram, X, Bluesky, Threads, and Reddit. Facebook and LinkedIn read the title from the page Open Graph metadata."
msgstr "Usado por Native Share, WhatsApp, e-mail, Telegram, X, Bluesky, Threads e Reddit. O Facebook e o LinkedIn leram o título dos metadados do Open Graph."

